URLs You can use presigned URLs to grant time-limited access to objects in Amazon S3 without updating your bucket policy. A presigned URL can be entered in a browser or used by a program to download an object. The credentials used by the presigned URL are those of the AWS Identity and Access Management (IAM) principal who generated the URL. Using presigned URLs to download and upload objects API Version 2006-03-01 502

